# workshop-app conventions

- App Router under `workshop-app/src/app/`
- **Design system:** Apple — tokens in `globals.css`, components in `src/components/ui/`
- shadcn/ui components in `workshop-app/src/components/ui/`
- Workshop content in `workshop-app/src/lib/workshop-data.ts`
- Layout helpers: `PageShell`, `PageHero`, `SectionTitle` in `page-shell.tsx`
- Run from `workshop-app/`: `npm run dev`, `npm run build`, `npm run lint`
